{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Days until my due date? 是一款陪伴準媽媽走過整個孕期的工具程式，由計算預產期與倒數計時開始，一路記錄每週孕期狀態、心情與渴望。無論是剛確認懷孕，還是進入最後數週的等待階段，都能清晰掌握時間並感受期待。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>預產期倒數與私密日記</h2>\n<p>程式以簡潔的預產期計算器與倒數為起點，讓使用者清楚掌握剩餘週數。內置智能計算器可估算受孕日期、追蹤重要里程碑，甚至協助規劃大學儲蓄。寶寶名字產生器提供趣味靈感，每週孕期狀態報告讓人掌握身體變化，私密日記可記下心情、夢境與飲食偏好，另有星座預測與輕鬆小遊戲。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-655-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-656-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-657-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-658-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-659-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-660-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Days until my due date?</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T04:38:51.595752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}